rules.notes:
The seminar requirement can be fulfilled by either;

• (i) taking one formal seminar course for credit each term, and/or

• (ii) enrolling in APPPHYS 290 and attending a minimum of eight informal talks or formal research seminars during each of the three terms; students enrolling in APPPHYS 290 must submit with their final MS program proposal a list of the eight talks/seminars with a paragraph describing the content, signed by their academic advisor
